  'c10-biology-044',
  NULL,
  '["Biomagnification is the increasing concentration of non-biodegradable toxins at each trophic level because toxins cannot be broken down and accumulate as predators eat many lower organisms.","It is the accumulation of non-biodegradable chemicals along a food chain, concentrating maximally in top consumers."]'::jsonb,
