  NULL,
  0.5,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'Combustion equation: C + O₂ -> CO₂. Moles of carbon burned = 24 g / 12 g/mol = 2.0 mol. By 1:1 stoichiometry, 2.0 mol of CO₂ is generated. Molar mass of CO₂ = 12 + 2(16) = 44 g/mol. Mass of CO₂ = 2.0 mol × 44 g/mol = 88 g.'
