  'Chemical Reactions and Equations',
  'numerical',
  'medium',
  'When 10.0 g of solid calcium carbonate [CaCO₃] is heated to complete decomposition according to CaCO₃(s) -> CaO(s) + CO₂(g), what mass of solid calcium oxide residue (in grams) remains? (Atomic masses: Ca = 40 u, C = 12 u, O = 16 u).',
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'g',
  NULL,
  2,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL
