  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'Sodium readily oxidizes in air to form Na₂O and Na₂O₂, and reacts vigorously with moisture: 2Na + 2H₂O -> 2NaOH + H₂ + Heat. The heat generated ignites the hydrogen gas. Kerosene shields it completely from air and water.'
