  'When 4.0 g of pure hydrogen gas [H₂] reacts completely with excess oxygen gas according to 2H₂(g) + O₂(g) -> 2H₂O(l), what mass of liquid water in grams is produced? (Atomic masses: H = 1 u, O = 16 u).',
