  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  '["Kisa Gotami carries her deceased child from house to house in grief, pleading for medicine.","A neighbour directs her to Sakyamuni Buddha, who promises medicine if she brings mustard seeds from a death-free home.","She travels to every household in the town, only to discover that every family has lost a parent, child, or friend.","Weary and hopeless, she sits at the roadside watching the city lights flicker up and extinguish in darkness.","She realizes that human lives flicker and extinguish like lights, and that death is the universal destiny of all mortals."]'::jsonb,
  'Progression: Bereaved search -> Meeting Buddha -> Quest for seeds -> Watching city lights -> Spiritual awakening on universal mortality.'
) ON CONFLICT (question_id) DO UPDATE SET
