"11\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"middle\">दोनों पद प्रधान (योजक)</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"150\" width=\"140\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"430\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#4338ca\" text-anchor=\"middle\">बहुव्रीहि</text><text x=\"430\" y=\"196\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"middle\">तीसरा अन्य पद प्रधान</text></svg>"}'::jsonb,
