  'c10-maths-039',
  '1665'::jsonb,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  0,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'Two-digit multiples of 3 form an AP: 12, 15, 18, ..., 99. Here a = 12, d = 3, l = 99. Number of terms n: 99 = 12 + (n - 1)3 => 87 = 3(n - 1) => n - 1 = 29 => n = 30. Sum S₃₀ = (n/2)(a + l) = (30/2)(12 + 99) = 15 × 111 = 1665.'
) ON CONFLICT (question_id) DO UPDATE SET
