  'image',
  'medium',
  'In the diagram, tangents PA and PB drawn from external point P to a circle with centre O are inclined to each other at an angle ∠APB = 80°. What is the measure of angle ∠POA in degrees?',
  '["50°","60°","70°","80°"]'::jsonb,
  '{"kind":"svg","src":"<svg xmlns=''http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'' viewBox=''0 0 320 200'' width=''100%'' height=''200''><rect width=''320'' height=''200'' fill=''#f8fafc'' rx=''8''/><circle cx=''190'' cy=''100'' r=''60'' fill=''none'' stroke=''#0f172a'' stroke-width=''2.5''/><circle cx=''190'' cy=''100'' r=''3.5'' fill=''#0f172a''/><line x1=''50'' y1=''100'' x2=''170'' y2=''45'' stroke=''#2563eb'' stroke-width=''2''/><line x1=''50'' y1=''100'' x2=''170'' y2=''155'' stroke=''#2563eb'' stroke-width=''2''/><line x1=''190'' y1=''100'' x2=''170'' y2=''45'' stroke=''#047857'' stroke-width=''2''/><line x1=''190'' y1=''100'' x2=''170'' y2=''155'' stroke=''#047857'' stroke-width=''2''/><line x1=''50'' y1=''100'' x2=''190'' y2=''100'' stroke=''#dc2626'' stroke-width=''1.5'' stroke-dasharray=''4,3''/><circle cx=''50'' cy=''100'' r=''4'' fill=''#2563eb''/><circle cx=''170'' cy=''45'' r=''4'' fill=''#047857''/><circle cx=''170'' cy=''155'' r=''4'' fill=''#047857''/><text x=''35'' y=''105'' font-family=''sans-serif'' font-size=''12'' font-weight=''bold'' fill=''#2563eb''>P</text><text x=''165'' y=''35'' font-family=''sans-serif'' font-size=''12'' font-weight=''bold'' fill=''#047857''>A</text><text x=''165'' y=''175'' font-family=''sans-serif'' font-size=''12'' font-weight=''bold'' fill=''#047857''>B</text><text x=''200'' y=''105'' font-family=''sans-serif'' font-size=''12'' font-weight=''bold'' fill=''#0f172a''>O</text><text x=''75'' y=''92'' font-family=''sans-serif'' font-size=''11'' font-weight=''bold'' fill=''#2563eb''>∠APB = 80°</text><text x=''140'' y=''90'' font-family=''sans-serif'' font-size=''11'' font-weight=''bold'' fill=''#dc2626''>∠POA = ?</text></svg>"}'::jsonb,
