  '["The algebraic sum of the deviations of all observations from their arithmetic mean is always zero: ∑(xᵢ - x̄) = 0.","The median of a continuous grouped distribution can be located graphically from the point of intersection of less-than and more-than ogives.","The mode corresponds to the value of the variate that occurs with the maximum frequency in the distribution.","The mean of grouped data cannot be calculated using the assumed mean method.","The median is more sensitive to extreme outlier observations than the mean.","Every grouped frequency distribution must have exactly two distinct modes."]'::jsonb,
