  'mcq',
  'medium',
  'The minute hand of a circular wall clock is 14 cm long. Find the surface area swept by the minute hand in a 5-minute interval: (Take π = 22/7)',
  '["154/3 cm² (~51.33 cm²)","154 cm²","77/3 cm² (~25.67 cm²)","308/3 cm² (~102.67 cm²)"]'::jsonb,
  NULL,
