  'c10-maths-076',
  '0'::jsonb,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'A quadratic polynomial with sum S and product P of zeroes is given by k[x² - Sx + P]. Here S = -1 and P = -20, so p(x) = x² - (-1)x + (-20) = x² + x - 20.'
