  'c10-maths-088',
  '9.63'::jsonb,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  0.05,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'Circumference 2 π r = 22 => 2 × (22 / 7) × r = 22 => r = 7 / 2 = 3.5 cm. Quadrant area = (1 / 4) π r² = (1 / 4) × (22 / 7) × (7 / 2)² = (1 / 4) × (22 / 7) × (49 / 4) = 77 / 8 = 9.625 ≈ 9.63 cm².'
) ON CONFLICT (question_id) DO UPDATE SET
