  'maths',
  'Some Applications of Trigonometry',
  'numerical',
  'hard',
  'From the roof of a 7 m high building, the angle of elevation of the top of a cable tower is 60° and the angle of depression of its base is 45°. Determine the total height of the cable tower in metres. (Use √3 ≈ 1.732, rounded to 2 decimal places):',
