  'c10-maths-090',
  '19.12'::jsonb,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  0.1,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'Let building height AB = 7 m, tower CD. From angle of depression 45°, horizontal distance d = AB / tan 45° = 7 / 1 = 7 m. From angle of elevation 60°, upper height of tower h_upper = d × tan 60° = 7√3 m. Total tower height = 7 + 7√3 = 7(1 + 1.732) = 7(2.732) = 19.124 ≈ 19.12 metres.'
) ON CONFLICT (question_id) DO UPDATE SET
