  'numerical',
  'hard',
  'A cylindrical metallic wire of uniform resistivity ρ has length l and initial resistance 16 Ω. If it is uniformly stretched without loss of mass so that its final length becomes double (2l), what is the new resistance of the wire in ohms?',
