  'c10-physics-039',
  '30'::jsonb,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  0.2,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'Focal length f = +20 cm. Real image on opposite side gives v = +60 cm. Lens formula: 1/f = 1/v - 1/u => 1/u = 1/v - 1/f = 1/60 - 1/20 = (1 - 3)/60 = -2/60 = -1/30. Therefore u = -30 cm, so magnitude is 30 cm.'
