  10,
  'physics',
  'Electricity',
  'image',
  'medium',
  'In the illustrated electrical circuit, resistor R₁ = 4 Ω is in series with a parallel pair R₂ = 6 Ω and R₃ = 3 Ω, powered by an ideal 12 V cell. What is the total current measured at ammeter A?',
  '["1.0 A","2.0 A","3.0 A","4.0 A"]'::jsonb,
  '{"kind":"svg","src":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 220\" width=\"100%\" height=\"200\"><rect width=\"400\" height=\"220\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" rx=\"8\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"110\" y=\"98\" width=\"50\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#fed7aa\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#9a3412\">R1=4Ω</text><line x1=\"160\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"230\" y=\"48\" width=\"50\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#fed7aa\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"238\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#9a3412\">R2=6Ω</text><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"230\" y=\"148\" width=\"50\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#fed7aa\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"238\" y=\"164\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#9a3412\">R3=3Ω</text><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"310\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"310\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"190\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"110\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#dbeafe\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"75\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e40af\">A</text><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"190\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"204\" y1=\"195\" x2=\"204\" y2=\"205\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"194\" y=\"185\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#047857\">12 V</text></svg>"}'::jsonb,
