  'c10-physics-042',
  NULL,
  '["Direct current flows unidirectionally while alternating current reverses periodically.","DC flows in one direction only; AC periodically reverses direction of flow."]'::jsonb,
  '["direction","reverses","periodically","fixed"]'::jsonb,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'DC flows unidirectionally from positive to negative terminal without reversing. In contrast, AC reverses direction periodically (e.g. 50 Hz in Indian domestic supplies where direction flips every 1/100 second).'
