  '["High pCO₂, high H⁺ concentration (low pH), and elevated temperature","Low pCO₂, low H⁺ concentration (high pH), and cold temperature","High pO₂ and high pH in pulmonary capillaries","Absence of 2,3-bisphosphoglycerate"]'::jsonb,
