  NULL,
  '["JG cells release renin which produces angiotensin II, causing vasoconstriction and aldosterone release to raise blood pressure and restore GFR","fall in GFR stimulates JG cells to secrete renin, activating the RAAS pathway to normalize GFR"]'::jsonb,
