  '2'::jsonb,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'N₂ has 14 electrons: σ1s² σ*1s² σ2s² σ*2s² (π2px² = π2py²) σ2pz². All electrons are paired (diamagnetic), and the bond order is (10 - 4)/2 = 3. O₂⁺ has bond order 2.5 (paramagnetic), O₂ has bond order 2 (paramagnetic with 2 unpaired electrons), and B₂ has bond order 1 (paramagnetic).'
