  NULL,
  '["he damaged the mummy by chiseling away the hardened resins and severing almost every major joint to remove the gold","Carter hacked away the body with chisels and cut off joints to steal or preserve gold ornaments, ruining the mummy"]'::jsonb,
  '["chiseled","resins","severed","joints","damaged","mummy","gold"]'::jsonb,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
