xt><text x=''75'' y=''45'' fill=''#ffffff'' font-size=''10'' text-anchor=''middle''>If + had V3 &rarr; would have V3</text><text x=''75'' y=''65'' fill=''#a7f3d0'' font-size=''9'' text-anchor=''middle''>Unfulfilled past regret</text></g></svg>"}'::jsonb,
