  'Combining terms: (sin 6x + sin 2x) - sin 4x = 2 sin 4x cos 2x - sin 4x = sin 4x (2 cos 2x - 1) = 0. Either sin 4x = 0 => 4x = nπ => x = nπ/4, or cos 2x = 1/2 => 2x = 2nπ ± π/3 => x = nπ ± π/6.'
