  NULL,
  NULL,
  'The general term is T_{r+1} = 12Cr (x²)^(12-r) (x⁻¹)^r = 12Cr x^(24 - 3r). Set 24 - 3r = 6 => 3r = 18 => r = 6. Coefficient = 12C6 = (12×11×10×9×8×7)/(720) = 924.'
