  0,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'By quotient rule: f''(x) = [2x(x² + 1) - (x² - 1)(2x)] / (x² + 1)² = 4x / (x² + 1)². At x = 1: f''(1) = 4(1) / (1 + 1)² = 4 / 4 = 1.'
