  '0'::jsonb,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'At the highest point, minimum speed v_top = √(gR). By conservation of mechanical energy: mgh = mg(2R) + (1/2)m(v_top)² = 2mgR + (1/2)mgR = (5/2)mgR => h = (5/2)R = 2.5R.'
