  11,
  'physics',
  'System of Particles and Rotational Motion',
  'mcq',
  'hard',
  'A solid cylinder and a thin circular hoop, both having identical mass M and radius R, roll down an inclined plane from rest without slipping from the same height. Find the ratio of their translational speeds at the bottom of the incline, v_cylinder / v_hoop.',
  '["√(4/3) = 2/√3","√(3/2)","4/3","√2"]'::jsonb,
  NULL,
