  'image',
  'easy',
  'A uniform thin rod of mass M and length L has moment of inertia I_CM = (1/12) M L² about an axis through its center. By the parallel axis theorem, what is its moment of inertia about an axis through one of its ends at distance d = L/2?',
  '["1/3 M L²","1/12 M L²","1/4 M L²","1/2 M L²"]'::jsonb,
  '{"kind":"svg","src":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 180\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"320\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#0f172a\"/><rect x=\"50\" y=\"80\" width=\"220\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" rx=\"3\"/><line x1=\"160\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#fbbf24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"20\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">CM (I = 1/12 ML²)</text><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#f87171\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"50\" y=\"20\" fill=\"#f87171\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">End axis (d = L/2)</text><text x=\"105\" y=\"120\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">L/2</text><text x=\"215\" y=\"120\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">L/2</text></svg>"}'::jsonb,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  2,
  NULL,
