  'c11-physics-090',
  '260'::jsonb,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  0,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'Initial frequency f₁ could be 256 + 4 = 260 Hz or 256 - 4 = 252 Hz. Loading wax lowers frequency. If it were 252 Hz, lowering it would increase the beat difference (> 4). Since beat frequency decreased to 2, f₁ must have been 260 Hz (which lowered to 258 Hz, giving |258 - 256| = 2).'
