  'c12-bio-016',
  '0'::jsonb,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'DNA polymerase can catalyse polymerisation only in the 5'' -> 3'' direction. On the template with 3'' -> 5'' polarity, synthesis is continuous (leading strand). On the template with 5'' -> 3'' polarity, synthesis proceeds discontinuously away from the replication fork as Okazaki fragments (lagging strand).'
) ON CONFLICT (question_id) DO UPDATE SET
