  'numerical',
  'hard',
  'A double-stranded DNA molecule contains 2000 base pairs (4000 total nucleotides). Biochemical analysis reveals that 30% of the total nitrogenous bases are Adenine. Calculate the exact number of Guanine bases present in this DNA molecule.',
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  1,
  NULL,
