  '["DNA migrates towards the positive anode (+); smaller molecular weight fragments migrate faster and farther through the agarose sieve","DNA migrates towards the negative cathode (-); larger fragments migrate farther","DNA migrates towards the anode (+); larger fragments migrate faster","Neutral DNA fragments remain stationary in the loading wells"]'::jsonb,
