  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'Because the man''s father was blood group O (ii), the man must be heterozygous I^A i. Because the woman''s mother was blood group O (ii), she must be heterozygous I^B i. A cross between I^A i and I^B i produces: I^A I^B (Group AB, 25%), I^A i (Group A, 25%), I^B i (Group B, 25%), and ii (Group O, 25%).'
