  '["Radioactive Phosphorus-32 (32P) for DNA, and Radioactive Sulfur-35 (35S) for protein coats","Radioactive Carbon-14 (14C) for DNA, and Nitrogen-15 (15N) for proteins","Radioactive Tritium (3H) for DNA, and Iodine-131 (131I) for proteins","Radioactive Sulfur-35 (35S) for DNA, and Phosphorus-32 (32P) for proteins"]'::jsonb,
