  0,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'The Mendelian monohybrid F2 genotypic ratio is 1 TT : 2 Tt : 1 tt (1/4 homozygous tall, 2/4 heterozygous tall, 1/4 homozygous dwarf). Therefore, the expected number of heterozygous tall (Tt) plants = (2 / 4) * 1200 = 600.'
