  'biology',
  'Organisms and Populations',
  'logic',
  'hard',
  'Given below are two statements labeled Assertion (A) and Reason (R):
Assertion (A): Brood parasitism in birds (such as the Asian koel laying eggs in the crow''s nest) represents an evolutionary arms race between host and parasite.
Reason (R): The parasitic bird''s eggs have evolved to closely mimic the host bird''s eggs in size and coloration, reducing the probability of the host bird detecting and rejecting foreign eggs.',
  '["Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are true and Reason (R) is the correct explanation of Assertion (A).","Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are true but Reason (R) is not the correct explanation of Assertion (A).","Assertion (A) is true but Reason (R) is false.","Assertion (A) is false but Reason (R) is true."]'::jsonb,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  1,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL
) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET
  question = EXCLUDED.question,
