  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'In CrO4 2-: x + 4(-2) = -2 => x = +6. In Cr2O7 2-: 2x + 7(-2) = -2 => 2x = 12 => x = +6. The interconversion is an acid-base condensation equilibrium without any redox change; chromium remains in the +6 oxidation state in both species.'
) ON CONFLICT (question_id) DO UPDATE SET
