  NULL,
  NULL,
  0.05,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'Ca(NO3)2 dissociates according to: Ca(NO3)2 -> Ca2+ + 2 NO3- (number of particles n = 3). van ''t Hoff factor i = 1 + (n - 1) * alpha = 1 + (3 - 1) * 0.70 = 1 + 2 * 0.70 = 1 + 1.40 = 2.40.'
