  'medium',
  'The diagram illustrates the core philosophical metaphor in Selma Lagerlöf''s ''The Rattrap''. What does the world set out as ''bait'' (represented by cheese and pork in a real trap) to ensnare human beings into the great rattrap of life?',
  '["Riches, joy, shelter, food, heat, and clothing","Academic fame and philosophical treatises","Religious piety and charitable donations","Solitude, poverty, and suffering"]'::jsonb,
  '{"kind":"svg","src":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 340 180\" width=\"100%\" height=\"160\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"40\" y=\"40\" width=\"260\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"10,6\"/><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"90\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#fde047\" stroke=\"#ca8a04\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"145\" y=\"95\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#854d0e\">BAIT</text><text x=\"50\" y=\"25\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#334155\">THE WORLD AS A RATTRAP</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"165\" font-size=\"12\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#64748b\">\"Touches the bait -> Door closes forever\"</text></svg>"}'::jsonb,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  1,
