  'Volume V = (4/3)π r³. dV/dt = 4π r² (dr/dt). For r = 10 and dr/dt = 0.5: dV/dt = 4π (100) (0.5) = 200π. Hence, k = 200.'
) ON CONFLICT (question_id) DO UPDATE SET
