  '0'::jsonb,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'Using the property ∫₀ᵃ f(x) dx = ∫₀ᵃ f(a - x) dx, we get I = ∫₀^(π/2) [cos⁴ x / (cos⁴ x + sin⁴ x)] dx. Adding the two expressions: 2I = ∫₀^(π/2) 1 dx = π/2 ⇒ I = π/4.'
