  'c12-maths-080',
  '0'::jsonb,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  '|a + b|² = |a|² + |b|² + 2(a · b) = 1² + 1² + 2(1)(1) cos θ = 1. Thus 2 + 2 cos θ = 1 ⇒ 2 cos θ = -1 ⇒ cos θ = -1/2 ⇒ θ = 2π/3 (120°).'
