  'physics',
  'Current Electricity',
  'image',
  'medium',
  'Consider the Wheatstone bridge circuit shown with four resistances P = 2 Ω, Q = 4 Ω, R = 3 Ω, and S = 6 Ω. Is the bridge balanced, and what current passes through the central galvanometer G?',
