  NULL,
  NULL,
  'At electrical resonance in a series LCR circuit, inductive reactance equals capacitive reactance: omega L = 1 / (omega C). Impedance Z = sqrt(R^2 + (X_L - X_C)^2) becomes minimum (Z = R) and current is in phase with voltage.'
