  12,
  'physics',
  'Semiconductor Electronics',
  'truefalse',
  'easy',
  'In a reverse-biased p-n junction diode, the barrier potential increases and the current flowing through the junction is primarily due to the drift of minority charge carriers.',
  NULL,
  NULL,
