  'c12-phy-076',
  '0'::jsonb,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'The binding energy curve peaks around mass number A = 56 (Iron-56) at approximately 8.75 MeV/nucleon. For intermediate nuclei (30 < A < 170), E_bn is nearly constant (~8.5 MeV). Very heavy nuclei have lower E_bn (~7.6 MeV for Uranium) and can undergo fission to release energy, while very light nuclei can undergo fusion.'
) ON CONFLICT (question_id) DO UPDATE SET
