  '0'::jsonb,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'For an inverse-square central electrostatic field (Virial theorem): Potential energy U = -e^2 / (4 pi eps0 r), Kinetic energy K = e^2 / (8 pi eps0 r) = -U / 2. Total energy E = K + U = K - 2K = -K = U / 2.'
