  '0'::jsonb,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'In a center-tapped full-wave rectifier, when one diode conducts, the non-conducting diode faces the peak voltage of the conducting half plus the peak voltage of its own half winding. Therefore, PIV = 2 Vm. In contrast, for a bridge rectifier PIV = Vm.'
) ON CONFLICT (question_id) DO UPDATE SET
