  'c12-phy-083',
  12,
  'physics',
  'Ray Optics and Optical Instruments',
  'mcq',
  'hard',
  'An optical fibre consists of a core of refractive index n1 surrounded by a cladding of refractive index n2 (n1 > n2). What is the numerical aperture (NA) of the fibre for light incident from air (n0 = 1)?',
  '["sqrt(n1^2 - n2^2)","sqrt(n1^2 + n2^2)","n1 / n2","n1 - n2"]'::jsonb,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  1,
