  'c12-phy-089',
  12,
  'physics',
  'Current Electricity',
  'numerical',
  'medium',
  'In a metre bridge experiment, the null point is obtained at a distance of 39.5 cm from the left end A when an unknown resistor X is in the left gap and a standard resistor Y = 12.5 ohms is in the right gap. Determine the value of resistance X in ohms (to two decimal places).',
