  'numerical',
  'hard',
  'A 100 microfarad capacitor in series with a 40 ohm resistor is connected across a 110 V (rms), 60 Hz AC supply. Calculate the peak (maximum) current I_0 in the circuit in amperes (to two decimal places).',
